createdby: DBot
description: |
  Lists assets eligible to be manually added to or removed from an AppSec application's override layer.
  Use this to discover candidate assets before using `CortexUpdateOverrideApplicationAssets` to modify the application.
  The `type` argument determines which assets are listed:
  - `Addable`: Lists assets available to be added (i.e., not currently in the application).
  - `Removable`: Lists assets currently in the application that can be removed.
  The application must be identified by either `application_id` or `application_name`.
